  "target_domain": "muscle-exertion",
  "subdomain": "Lactate and glycolysis",
  "finding": "Long COVID patients show early lactate accumulation and reduced fat oxidation during exercise, with plasma metabolite and lipid shifts consistent with impaired mitochondrial fatty-acid use.",
